User Story: Improve Add Product Success Rate
Task: Testing Analytics and Feedback

Overview:
As a tester, I verified that analytics and feedback mechanisms 
accurately tracked and reported the success rate of adding products. 
Metrics such as completion rates, error occurrences, and user interactions
were tested for accuracy. Feedback prompts were evaluated for clarity and relevance. 
Testing confirmed that insights were correctly logged and displayed in analytics dashboards, with no data discrepancies.

